# VitaChain Global Foods Database (Curated ~500 items)

This file contains a comprehensive list of common global food items with nutritional information per 100g.

## Instructions
This JSON will be processed by the download script to create `public/data/global-foods.json`.

Schema per item:
```json
{
  "id": "gf_001",
  "name": "Food Name",
  "category": "category",
  "servingSize": "description",
  "per100g": {
    "calories": number,
    "protein": number,
    "carbs": number,
    "fat": number,
    "fiber": number,
    "sodium": number
  },
  "region": "Region name",
  "description": "Brief description"
}
```
